window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A war is coming.</b></p> <p>The Solaris Initiative is gaining ground, and more supporters join the rebellion every day, but the Sarkonian Empire has major cards left to play.</p> <p>Alyss Cortez, soldier turned rebel, embarks on her most dangerous mission ever: infiltrating an ultra-elite military black site that holds the key to crippling the enemy. With no backup, memory, or clothes, she’ll have to use her wits to survive and stop a madman from taking control of the government.</p> <p>Go along for a wild ride with the third installment of the Fifth Column from <i>USA Today</i> best-selling author J.N. Chaney and Molly Lerma. If you're a fan of <i>Firefly </i>and <i>Battlestar Galactica</i>, this is just the thing for you.</p>"; 
